 "officialTitle": "Compare the Safety and Efficacy of 177Lu-DOTATATE and Octreotide LAR in Unresectable or Metastatic, Progressive, Well-differentiated(G1 and G2) and SSTR-positive Adult GEP-NEN",
 "leadSponsor": {
