 "officialTitle": "Symphony-1: A Phase 1b/3 Double-Blind, Randomized, Active-Controlled, 3-Stage, Biomarker Adaptive Study Of Tazemetostat Or Placebo In Combination With Lenalidomide Plus Rituximab In Subjects With Relapsed/Refractory Follicular Lymphoma",
 "leadSponsor": {
