 "officialTitle": "A US Phase 3b, Multi-center, Randomized, Double-blind, Double-Dummy Study to Evaluate Efficacy of Remibrutinib Compared to Dupilumab at Early Timepoints in Adults With Chronic Spontaneous Urticaria Inadequately Controlled by Second Generation H1-Antihistamines",
